# Authored JSON assets, wherever they live (Tests folders included -- they are assets too).
# Kept out of dmp-HROT.Subsys.dumpfilter so no file reaches the notebook twice.
- *

+ **/*.btree.json
+ **/*.btree.v1.json
+ **/*.hsm.json
+ **/*.hsm.v1.json
+ **/*.bp.json
+ **/*.params.json

- **/.*
- **/obj
- **/bin
- **/build
- **/artifacts
- TestResults
